    {
      id: "5"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        css:
          "return `._id { font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.65; color: ${args.theme.var.color.text}; margin: 0; }`;"
        displayOrder: 3
        textType: markdown
        componentName: Html
        text:
          "### 1. Open the app\n\nFrom Shopify admin, open **Decode Orders Organizer**.\n\n### 2. Choose a workspace\n\n- **Orders** — production orders.\n- **Draft orders** — drafts you are building or reviewing.\n\n### 3. Use the category sidebar\n\nPick or create categories to organize rows. Expand the tree to nest groups the way your team works.\n\n### 4. Scan the table, then expand\n\nUse sort, search, and filters on the grid. Click a row’s expand control to reveal **line items** and extra fields.\n\n### 5. Adjust Settings\n\nUse **Settings** on that page to show or hide columns and tune expansion. Orders and drafts can be configured separately.\n\n### Next steps\n\nRead **[Documentation](/docs)** or **[FAQ](/faq)**; contact **[Support](/support)** if you are stuck."
        props: "return { as: \"div\" }"
      }
    }
    {
      id: "6"
      L: PageLayout
      P: {
        componentName: ShopifyLayout
      }
    }
